  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "動態影像美學",
    "sub_ename": "AESTHETICS OF MOTION DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主旨為(1)介紹影像美學概念與基本語彙，作為影片賞析與創作的基礎；(2)透過短影片作品分析來學習從品牌意象到視覺化過程，以及(3)理解短影片敘事結構與影像製作技巧。課程以小組為單位進行專案實作，從影片意象定位、分鏡腳本、拍攝到剪輯後製，讓同學了解整體影片製作過程。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to provide students with a comprehensive understanding of the technical and aesthetic issues of motion design. In this introductory course, the context of time-based media, the integration of imagery, sound and video, as well as storyboard production are covered. Students are also required to apply this knowledge and these techniques to a completed short commercial film project.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
